<title>POLAND: Exbud ups stake in builder to 76.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Exbud ups stake in builder to 76.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Exbud SA has increased its stake in Wroclaw-based construction firm Energomontaz-Zachod SA to 76.7 percent, Exbud said in a statement of Friday.</p>
<p>Exbud, which previously held 46.7 percent of Energomontaz, raised its stake by taking up 209,501 shares worth 4.2 million zlotys in an Energomontaz capital raise, giving the latter a share capital of 8.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
